- trace schema remains 3;
- schema2 remains the default when summaries are disabled;
- summary contract v1 remains the default for historical summary commands;
- contract v1 and v2 field sets are strictly isolated;
- all historical v1/v2 frozen files remain byte-identical;
- the default schema2 byte fixture remains unchanged.

